1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:04,620
Children's Law

2
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:12,220
Article 37. Children's obligations to family

3
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:22,170
1. Respect, courtesy, filial piety to grandparents, parents;

4
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:35,050
love, care, share feelings, wishes with parents and family members, relatives.

5
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:46,850
2. Study, train, maintain family tradition,

6
00:00:46,850 --> 00:01:01,070
help parents and family members with work suitable for age, gender and child development.

7
00:01:01,070 --> 00:01:13,300
Article 38. Children's obligations to school, social assistance centers and other educational institutions

8
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:27,350
1. Respect teachers, staff, employees of school, social assistance centers and other educational institutions.

9
00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:40,300
2. Love, unite, share difficulties, respect, help friends.

10
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:50,300
3. Train morality, self-study awareness, implement learning tasks,

11
00:01:50,300 --> 00:02:00,670
train according to programs, educational plans of school, other educational institutions.

12
00:02:00,670 --> 00:02:23,350
4. Keep, protect property and fully comply with regulations of school, social assistance centers and other educational institutions.

